<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2 Corinthians</book>
  <para style="h">2 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Corinthians</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Pathian duh zâwnga Krista Isua tirhkoh leh kan unaupa Timothea chuan, Korinth khuaa Pathian kohhranho awmte hnênah, Akaia ram zawng zawnga mi thianghlim awm zawng zawngte hnênah nên:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian kan Pa leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista Pathian leh Pa, khawngaihnate Pa leh thlamuanna zawng zawng Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathianin keimahni min thlamuanna ngeiin, hrehawm eng anga awmte pawh chu kan thlamuan ve theihna tûrin, ani chuan kan hrehawmna zawng zawngah min thlamuan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Krista tuarnate chu kan chunga a chuang a liam ang tak hian, kan thlamuanna hi Krista zârah a chuang a liam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, hrehawma kan awm leh, nangmahni thlamuanna tûr leh chhandamna tûr a ni a; thlamuana kan awm leh, nangmahni thlamuan vena tûr a ni a, chu chuan kan hrehawm tuar bawk hi chhel taka in tuarnaah chuan a thawk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hrehawmna chang vete in nih ang hian, thlamuanna chang vete in ni bawk tih kan hriatin kan beiseisakna che u hi a nghet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Unaute u, Asia rama kan chunga hrehawm thleng thu kha in hriat loh kan duh lo va, khatia, nasa taka, tuar zawh rual lohva, nun rêng pawh beisei lo khawp hiala delh beha kan awm kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ni, thih mai chauh hmabâk tawhin kan inhria a, mahni inring lova, Pathian, mitthi kaithotu chu kan rin zâwk theihna tûr a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutianga thihna râpthlâk ata chu Pathianin min chhan chhuak tawh a, min la chhan chhuak leh ang; min la chhan chhuak leh zêl dâwn tih amahah chuan beiseina kan nghat a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mi tam tak zâra thilpêk kan hmuh avângin, mi tam takin kan chunga lâwmthu an sawi theihna tûrin nangni pawhin in mi ṭawngṭaisaknaah chuan min ṭan rualpui ula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan chhuan chu hei hi a ni, kan chhia leh ṭha hriatna thu hriattîr chu, thianghlimna leh Pathian dikna neiin, tisa finnaah ni lovin, Pathian khawngaihna zâwkin khawvêlah hian kan chêt kha, nangmahni lamah kan che ṭha lehzual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In chhiar ṭhina, âwih pawh in âwiha lo kha chu thu dang rêng rêng in hnênah kan ziak lo; kan Lalpa Isua Ni-ah chuan nangni kan chhuan in ni dâwn ang bawkin, keini pawh in chhuan kan ni dâwn tih in zînga ṭhenkhatin min âwihsak ve tâk ang khân, a tâwp thlengin kan thu chu in âwih ka beisei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chu rinna chu neiin, khawngaihna leh hnih in hmuh theihna tûrin, in hnênah lo kal hmasa ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nangmahni tlawh pahin Makedonia ramah kal zêl ila, Makedonia ram aṭangin in hnênah lo lêt leh ila ka ti a; tin, Judai rama ka kalna tûrah chuan nangmahni thlahin awm ila ka ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, chutiang ka rilrûk lai khân ka rilru ngheh lohzia lantîr em ni ka nih? A nih loh leh, ka hnênah, “A ni, a ni,” tih leh, “A ni lo, a ni lo,” tih chu awm ve ve tûrin, thiltih ka tum ṭhin chu tisa angin em ni ka tum?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eng pawh ni rawh se, Pathian a rinawm angin, nangmahni lamah kan thu hi, “A ni,” tih leh, “A ni lo,” tih a ni ve ve si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian Fapa Isua Krista, a thu kei leh Silvana leh Timothean in zînga kan hrila kha, “A ni” leh “A ni lo” a ni ve ve si lo va, amahah chuan, “A ni,” tih a awm zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian thutiamte chu eng zât pawh ni se, amahah chuan, “A ni,” tih chu a awm si a; chutichuan, amah avâng pawhin “Amen” tih chu a âwm a ni, keimahni avânga Pathian ropuina tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Kristaa nangmahni nêna min tinghettu leh keini hriak min thihtu chu Pathian a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ani chu min chhinchhiahtu leh kan thinlunga zakhamna Thlarau min petu a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka thlarau chunga hretu atân Pathian ka ko a ni; nangmahni zuah tûr che uin a ni Korinth khuaa ka lo kal tâk loh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In rinna chungah lalna kan nei ka ti lo va, in lâwmna ṭanpuitu kan ni ka ti zâwk a ni; rinnaa ding in ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nimahsela, keima lam thûah zawng hei hi ka lo tum ta tlat a ni, lungngai chung chuan in hnêna lo kal leh tawh lo tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keiin ka tihlungngaih si che u chuan, ka tihlungngaiha vêk lo chuan tu nge mi tilâwmtu ni ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, kha ngei kha ka ziak a ni; chuti lo chuan, ka lo kal hunah, ka lâwmna tûrte lakah chuan lungngaihna ka hmu zâwk dah ang e; ka lâwmna chu in zaa lâwmna a nih ka rinsak hlawm si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mittui tam tak tla chungin, thinlung hrehawm leh thlaphâng êm êma ka ziak a nih kha; chu chu tihlungngaiha in awmna tûr a ni lo va, in chunga hmangaihna nasa lehzual ka neih hi in hriat theih zâwkna tûrin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, tu pawhin mite a tihlungngaih chuan, keimah chauh mi tilungngai a ni lo va, (ka tih luattuk lohna tûrin) in zain a tilungngai hlek ṭheuh zâwk che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutiang mi tân chuan mi tam takin an hrem chu a tâwk tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, hrem leh tawh ahnêkin in ngaidamin in thlamuan zâwk tûr a ni; chuti lo chuan, eng emaw tiin mi chutiang chu a lungngaih lutuknain a lem zo dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan ama lama in hmangaihna chu tinghet tûrin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hemi avâng pawh hian ka ziak a ni, kawng tinrênga thu in âwih leh âwih loh ka fiah theihna tûr che uin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eng kawngah pawh mi in ngaihdam apiang, kei pawhin ka ngaidam ve a; kei pawhin ka ngaihdam tawh sa chu, eng pawh ka lo ngaihdam tawh chuan nangmahni avângin Krista hmaah chuan ka ngaidam a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chuti lo chuan, Setanan min dinchan khalh dah ang e; a ngamthlêmna chu kan hai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Krista Chanchin Ṭha hril tûra Troas khua ka thlen lai khân, Lalpaah chuan kawng mi lo hawnsak na a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ka unaupa Tita chu ka hmuh loh avângin ka thlarau lamah chuan muanna rêng rêng ka nei chuang lo va; chutichuan, anni chu ṭawng ṭhain ka ṭhen a, ka chhuak a, Makedonia ramah ka kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Kristaa hnehnaa min hruai fotu leh, keimahni hmanga hmun tina amah hriatna rim hriattîrtu Pathian hnênah chuan lâwmthu awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chhandam mêkahte leh boral mêkahte chuan Pathian tân Krista rimtui kan ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />pâwl khatte tân chuan thihna lakah thihna tûr rim kan lo ni a, pâwl khatte tân chuan nunna laka nunna tûr rim kan lo ni a. Chûng ang atân chuan tu nge tling zo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tam takin Pathian thu hi mite buma sumdâwn nân an hmang angin keini zawngin kan hmang ve si lo va; tihtak zet zâwkin, Pathian tirh zâwkin, Pathian mit hmuhin Kristaah chuan thu kan sawi ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mahni insawimawi kan ṭan leh dâwn ta maw? A nih loh leh, in hnêna pêk tûr emaw, in hnên ata emaw sawimawina lehkha, mi ṭhenkhat tân a ngai angin kan tân a ngai ve dâwn maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangni hi kan lehkha, kan thinlunga ziak, mi zawng zawng hriat leh chhiar chu in ni e:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Krista lehkha, keimahni min ziaktîr, lehkhatuia ziak ni lo, Pathian nung Thlarauva ziak zâwk, lung phêka ziak ni lo, tisa thinlung phêka ziak zâwk chu in ni tih chiang taka lantîr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Pathian lamah chutiang rinna chu Krista zâra kan neih a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />eng pawh keimahni aṭanga chhuaka ruat tûrin keimahni ngawtin kan tlin kan ti lo va; kan tlin theihna chu Pathian hnên ata a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah bawk chuan thuthlung thar rawngbâwltuahte min tlintîr a; a lehkha thu mai rawngbâwltuahte ni lovin, a thlarau rawngbâwltuahte a ni zâwk e; lehkha thu mai chuan a tihlum si ṭhîn a, thlarau erawh chuan a tinung ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosia hmêl a ropui avângin Israel fate chuan a hmêl an en reng thei lo va (chu ropuina chu a ral ta riai riai a), thihna rawngbâwlna, lunga hawrawpa ziak mah chuti khawpa ropuia a thlen chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlarau rawngbâwlna chu engti taka ropuiin thleng ang maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thiam loh chantîrna rawngbâwlna mah a ropui chuan, felna rawngbâwlna chu ropui lamah chuan a nasa zâwk êm êm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tihropuia awm tawha chuan hemi lamah zawng ropuina rêng a nei ta si lo, ropuina nasa zâwk chuan a khûm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ral ta riai riaia mah ropuia a thlen chuan, awm reng tûra chu ropuia thuamin a awm zâwk êm êm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, chutiang beiseina chu kan neih avângin engkim kan sawi chhuak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia tih ang khân kan ti lo ve; ani chuan ral ta riai riaia ral tâwpna chu Israel fate chuan an en reng lohna tûrin, a hmai chu hmai khuhnain a khuh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />an rilru erawh chu tihkhauhvin a awm ta zâwk a; vawiin thleng pawh hian thuthlung hlui chu an chhiarin khuhna pângngai chu hlîm lohvin a awm reng si a, chu khuhna chu Kristaah chuan tihbovin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, vawiin thleng hian Mosia Lehkhabu an chhiar apiangin, an thinlungah chuan khuhna a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, an thinlung chu Lalpa lama a hawi tik apiangin, khuhna chu lâk bo a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu Thlarau a ni a; Lalpa Thlarau awmna apiangah chuan zalênna a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, keini chu kan zain hmai khuh lovin, dârthlalang anga Lalpa chhun ênin, ropuina aṭanga ropui zêlin, chumi anpui ngeia awm tûrin tihdanglamin kan awm ṭhîn, Lalpa (Thlarau) ata chu kan hmuh ang zêlin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan khawngaihna kan hmuh ang zêla he rawngbâwlna hi kan neih avângin kan dawl lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />thil zahthlâk inthupte chu kan malmâk ta zâwk a, ngamthlêmna thu kan hmang lo va, Pathian thu mi bum nân kan hmang hek lo; thutak hriattîrin Pathian mit hmuhin mi tin chhia leh ṭha hriatna mit kan intluntîr zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, kan Chanchin Ṭha hi khuha a awm chuan, boral mêkahte hian a ni, khuha a awm ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Krista, Pathian anpui, a ropuizia Chanchin Ṭha êng chuan anmahni a chhun ên theih lohna tûrin, chûngahte chuan he khawvêl pathian hian ringlote rilru a tidel ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahni thu kan hril si lo va, Krista Isua chu Lalpa a nih kan hril zâwk ṭhîn a, keini pawh Isua avânga in bâwih kan nih kan hril bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isua Krista hmêlah chuan Pathian ropuizia hriatna êng chu min pe tûrin, “Thim ata êng a êng chhuak ang,” titu Pathian chuan kan thinlungte hi a chhun êng ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, thiltihtheihna nasatzia chu keimahni hnêna mi ni lovin, Pathian ta a nih theih zâwkna tûrin chu ro chu hlum bêlahte kan vawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lehlam lehlama nêksâwrin kan awm a; nimahsela, kan thaw a ipik si lo; mangangin kan awm a; nimahsela, kan bei a dawng si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tihduhdahin kan awm a; nimahsela, kalsanin kan awm si lo; vuak thlûkin kan awm a; nimahsela, tihboralin kan awm si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kan taksaah hian kumkhuain Isua thihna chu kan pu zêl ṭhîn a, Isua nunna pawh kan taksaah hian a lan theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keini nungdama la awmte hi Isua avânga thi tûra mantîrin kan awm fo va, Isua nunna pawh kan tisa thi theiah hian a lan theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, keimahniah hian thihnain a thawk ṭhîn a, nangniah erawh chuan nunnain a thawk zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, “Ka ring a; chuvângin, thu ka sawi a ni,” tih ziak ang khân, chumi rinna rilru ngei puin keini pawhin kan ring ve a; chuvângin, thu kan sawi bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa Isua kaithotu chuan keini pawh Isua hnênah min kai tho ve dâwn a, nangmahni nên min dintîr dâwn tih kan hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engkim nangmahni ṭhatna tûr a ni si a, khawngaihna chu mi tam zâwk zâra tihpuna awmin, Pathian ropuina tûrin lâwmthu nasa tak a sawitîr theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi avângin kan dawl lo va; kan pâwn lam mihring hi lo awngrawp telh telh mah sela, kan chhûng lam mihring chu ni tin siam thar zêlin a awm zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan hrehawm nêp tak, tûn mit khap kâr chhûng chauhva awm tûr hian, ropuina nasa tak chatuan atân min siamsak nasa tulh tulh a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />thil hmuh theihte hi en lovin, thil hmuh theih lohte chu kan en zâwk si a; thil hmuh theihte hi rei lo tê atân a ni a, thil hmuh theih lohte erawh chu chatuan atân a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan awmna leia in hi ṭhiat mah sela, vânah in, kuta sak loh, chatuana awm tûr, Pathian hnên ata in nghet chu kan nei tih kan hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vân ata kan awmna tûr sin thuah châk êm êmin hemi inah hian kan rûm tak meuh si ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chutianga sinin awm ila saruakin kan awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keini he awmnaa awmte hi rit phurin kan rûm tak zet si a; sin lova awm kan duh vâng a ni lo va, sin thuaha awm kan duh vâng a ni zâwk, thi thei hi nunna lem zawhin a awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chumi ngei atâna min buatsaihtu chu Pathian a ni, zakhamna Thlarau min petu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, taksaa kan awm chhûng hian Lalpa hnênah kan awm lo tih hriain, kumkhuain muang takin kan awm ṭhîn
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />(hmu theia kal lovin, rinnain kan kal zâwk si a);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />muang takin kan awm, ka ti, taksaa awm lova Lalpa hnêna awm kan duh zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, awm ila, awm suh ila, ama lâwm zâwng mi nih kan tum tlat ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tinin taksaa thiltihte, a chhia a ṭhain, kan tih ang zêla kan hmuh ṭheuh theihna tûrin, Krista rorêlna ṭhutphah hmaah chuan tihlanin kan awm vek tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa ṭih nachâng hriain mihringte chu kan thlêm ṭhîn a, Pathian hnênah erawh chuan lantîrin kan awm a; nangmahni chhia leh ṭha hriatnaah pawh lantîra kan awm ka beisei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In hnênah kan insawi mawi leh a ni lo va, thinlung lam ni lova, a lang lam mai chhuangtute chu eng emaw chhânna tûr in neih theihna tûrin, keimahni lamah chhuan chhan siam che uin kan sawi zâwk a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan ât leh Pathian tân a ni a; kan fin leh nangni tân a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista hmangaihna chuan min tîr lui a ni; heti hian kan ngaihtuah: mi zawng zawng thih aiin mi pakhat a thi a; chuvângin, mi zawng zawng chu an thi a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, a nungte chu anmahni tân an nun tawh loh va, an thih aia thia tho leha tân chuan an nun tawh zâwkna tûrin a ni mi zawng zawng thih aiin a thih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan tûn achinah hian keini zawngin tisa lamah chuan tu mah kan hre tawh lo vang; tisa lamah Krista chu lo hre tawh mah ila, tûnah zawng kan hre leh tawh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan tu pawh Kristaa a awm chuan thilsiam thar a lo ni a; thil hluite chu a ral ta a; ngai teh u, a lo thar ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, engkim hi Pathian hnên ata chhuak a ni a; ani chuan Krista avângin amah nên inremin min siam a, inremna rawngbâwl hna min pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khatia, Pathianin Kristaah chuan khawvêl hi amah nên inremin a siama, an bawhchhiatnate chu bawhchhiatnaa ruatsak lova, inremna thu min kawltîr kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Krista aia palai kan ni a, Pathianin keimahni min hmangin a ngên chiam che u tih theih a ni; “Pathian nên lo inrem rawh u,” tiin Krista aiah kan ngên che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amahah chuan Pathian felna kan lo nih theihna tûrin, sual rêng rêng hre lo chu Pathianin keimahni avângin sualah a siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Pathian khawngaihna chu sâwtpui lova in hmuh lohna tûrin, amah thawhpuituten kan ngên chiam a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hun lâwmawmah ka ngaithla che a, Chhandamna nîah ka ṭanpui che,” a ti si a. Ngai teh u, tûn hi hun lâwmawm chu a ni a; ngai teh u, tûn hi chhandamna ni chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan rawngbâwl hna hi an dem lohna tûrin, eng kawngah mah tlûk phahna tûr rêng rêng kan siam lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian rawngbâwltute angin engkimah mi mit tlungin kan awm zâwk ṭhîn, nasa taka chhelnaah te, hrehawmnaah te, nêksâwrnaah te, hnawh chêpnaah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />vuaknaah te, lung in tânnaah te, buainaah te, thawh rimnaah te, mutmawhnaah te, chaw ngheinaah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thianghlimnaah te, hriatnaah te, dawhtheihnaah te, ngilneihnaah te, Thlarau Thianghlimah te, hmangaihna tak takah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />thutak thûah te, Pathian thiltihtheihnaah te; ding lam leh vei lama felna hriamhreitein,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ropuina leh chawimawi lohnain, hming sawi chhiat leh hming sawiṭhatin; tihdertu angin, mi dik tak ni siin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi hriat tham loh angin, hmingthang tak siin; thi lek lek angin, ngai teh u, kan nung si; thunun angin, tihhlum si lohvin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />lungngai angin, nimahsela, lâwm fo siin; rethei angin, nimahsela, mi tam tak tihausa siin; eng mah nei lo angin, nimahsela, engkim ngah siin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw, Korinth-a mite u, kan thinlung pawh phawrh vekin in hnênah thu kan sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kan inhawng a, nangni erawh chu in inhawng ve si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, in chunga kan tih ang bawk khân, nangni pawh kan lakah inhawng ve tûrin fate ngenin kan ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ringlomite nên rual lo taka nghâwngkawl bât dûnin awm suh u; suahsualna leh felnain eng nge inṭâwmna an neih? A nih loh leh thim leh êngin eng nge inpâwlna an neih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Beliara leh Krista pawhin eng nge inzawmna an neih? A nih loh leh ringlo leh ringtu chuan eng nge chan dun an neih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Milemte leh Pathian biak in pawhin eng nge inremna an neih? Keini zawng Pathian nung biak in kan ni si; Pathianin, “Anmahniah ka awm ang a, Anmahniah ka lêng bawk ang; Tin, an Pathian ka ni ang a, Anni pawh ka mite an ni ang,” a tih ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, “ ‘An zîng ata lo chhuak ula, A hrangin awm rawh u, Thil bawlhhlawh rêng rêng pawh dek suh u.’ Lalpan a ti.” Chutichuan, “ ‘Ka lâwm ang che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In tân Pa ka ni ang a, Nangni pawh ka tân fanu fapa in ni ang,’ Lalpa Engkimtitheia chuan a ti.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, duh takte u, chûng thutiam chu kan neih avângin, tisa leh thlarau bawlhhlawhna zawng zawngah i intifai ang u, Pathian ṭih dêk chunga thianghlimna tifamkimin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In thinlungah hmun min kian rawh u; tu chungah mah kan tisual lo va, tu mah kan tikhawlo lo va, tu mah kan dinchan khalh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu chu thiam loh chantîr tûr che uin ka ti a ni lo ve; thih leh thi tlânga, dam leh dam tlâng tûrin kan thinlungah hian kan vawng che u tih hmân lawkah khân ka sawi kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni lamah chuan ka ṭawng ngamzia hi a nasa a, ka chhuanzia che u hi a nasa a ni; thlamuannain ka khat a, kan hrehawmna zawng zawngah chuan hlimin ka khat liam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Makedonia ram kan thlen pawh khân, kan tisain muanna rêng rêng a nei chuang lo va, lehlam lehlamah tihhrehawmin kan awm ta zâwk a; pâwn lamah insualnate a awm a, chhûng lamah hlauhnate a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, inngaitlâwmte thlamuantu Pathian chuan, Tita lo kalna chuan min thlamuan ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a lo kalna chauh chuan a ni lo va, in lunglênzia te, in ṭahzia te, ka chunga in ṭhahnemngaihzia te min hrilhin, nangmahnia a thlamuanna pawh chuan min thlamuan ta a ni; chutichuan, ka lâwm lehzual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lehkhathawn khân tilungngai che u mah ila ka inchhîr ta lo; a tîrah erawh kha chuan ka inchhîr a ni, kha lehkhathawn khân a tilungngai che u tih ka hriat avângin; nimahsela, rei lo tê chauh a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah chuan ka lâwm a ni, tihlungngaiha in awm avâng a ni lo va, simna tûra in lungngaih avâng a ni zâwk e. Keimahni avânga eng mah in chân lohna tûrin Pathian duh zâwng anga tihlungngaihin in awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian duh zâwnga lungngaihna chuan chhandamna tûra simna a thlen a, chu chu inchhîrawm loh tak a ni a. Khawvêl lungngaihna erawh chuan thihna a thlen zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh mah u, Pathian duh zâwnga tihlungngaiha in awmna chuan thil lâk urhsûnna te, pawi khawih ve lo in ni tih lantîr duhna te, sual huatna leh sual hlauhna te, min ngaihna leh ṭhahnemngaihna te, sual titu thunun zêl tûra inpeihna te a neihtîr tâk che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, in hnênah ziak mah ila, a sual titu vâng khân ka ziak lo va, a sual tuartu vâng khân ka ziak hek lo, kan chunga in ṭhahnemngaihzia Pathian mit hmuha in hnêna hriattîra a awm theihna tûrin ka ziak zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, thlamuanin kan awm ta rêng a; keimahni thlamuanna chauh lovah pawh, Tita lâwmna avangin kan lâwm nasa lehzual a, nangni zawng zawngin a rilru in tihharhsak tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnênah eng kawngah pawh nangmahni chhuang che u mah ila, ka mualpho si lo va; mualpho ahnêkin engkim in hnêna thu tak tak kan sawi ṭhîn ang khân, Tita hmaa kan chhuan chu thu tak tak a lo ni ta ngei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, in zaa a thu in awihzia te, hlau leh khûr chunga amah in lawmzia te chu hre rengin, a thinlung chu nangmahni lamah a chêng nasa lehzual ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kawng tinrêngah in chunga ka muan avângin ka lâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, unaute u, Makedonia rama kohhranho pâwlte zînga Pathian khawngaihna pêk chu kan hriattîr dâwn a che u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />khatia hrehawma fiahna nasa tak chunga an hlimna liam leh nasa taka an retheihna chu a liam a, an thilphalna nasa taka a chan tâkzia kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawngaihna, mi thianghlimte rawngbâwla tel ve chu, nasa taka min dîl chiamin, an theih tâwkin, a ni, an theih tâwk aia liam pawh, anmahni duh thu ngeiin an pe tih ka hriatpui asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu pawh chu kan rin loh ang takin an ti a, Pathian duh zâwngin anmahni ngei Lalpa hnênah leh keini hnênah an inpe hmasa tê tê a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmâna a lo tih ṭan tawh avâng khân, he khawngaihna pawh hi nangmahnia ti zo nghâl tûrin Tita chu kan ngên ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, engkim - rinna te, thusawi thiamna te, hriatna te, ṭhahnemngaihna zawng zawng te, min hmangaihna te in ngah ang hian, chu khawngaihna pawh chu in ngah theih nân taihmâk chhuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu pe lamin ka sawi lo va, mi dang ṭhahnemngaihnain in hmangaihna takzia pawh chu fiah tûrin ka sawi zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu, a retheihna avânga in lo hausak theihna tûrin, hausa mah sela nangmahni avâng ngeiin a lo retheih tâk kha in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, chumiah chuan ka ngaih dân ang a ni ka sawi ni, chu chu in tân a ṭha si a. Kum khat a ni tawh, a ṭan hmasatute in ni a, in ti ṭan chauh pawh ni lovin, duh pawh in duh ṭan ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, duh tûrin inpeihna a awm ang khân, in neih ang zêla hlenna pawh a awm theihna tûrin, tûnah zawng ti hlen tawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Inpeihna chu a awm phawt chuan, mi a neih loh pui ni lovin, a neih angzia zêla a pêk chu lawm tlâk a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi dang an rim loh va, nangni in rimna tûrin ka ti a ni lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />inchawhrual nân, in neih liam chu tûnlai hian an tlâkchham phuhrûkna a lo niha, an neih liam pawh in tlâkchham phuhrûkna a lo la nih ve thung theihna tûrin ka ti zâwk a ni; chutichuan, chawhrualna a lo awm thei ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A chhar tam chuan a chuangin a nei lo va, a chhar tlêm chuan a tlachham hek lo,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, in chunga ka ṭhahnemngaihna ang Tita thinlunga pe ṭhîntu Pathian hnênah chuan lâwmthu awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan kan ngenna chu a pawm ngei a; nimahsela, kan ngen avâng chauh ni lovin, amah ngei chu ṭhahnemngai tak a ni a, ama duhthlan ngeiin in hnêna kal tûrin a chhuak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah unaupa kan tîr ve dâwn a, ani chu Chanchin Ṭha kawnga an fak thu kohhranho zawng zawngah a thang chhuak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />chuti chauh pawh a ni lo va, Lalpa ropuina tûr leh kan inpeihzia entîr tûra a rawng kan bâwl he khawngaihna thûah hian, kan hnêna khaw fang ve tûra kohhranho ruat ve rêng a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A rawng kan bâwl he thilpêk kawngah hian tu mân min dem lohna tûrin kan fîmkhur a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa ngaih chauhvah ni lovin, mihring ngaih pawha thil mawi kan ngaihtuah lâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah kan unaupa kan kaltîr ve dâwn a, ani chu kawng tam takah ṭhahnemngai tak a ni tih vawi tam tak kan fiah tawh a, tûnah phei chuan a rin êm êm che u avângin ṭhahnem a ngai nasa lehzual ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tita hi chu ka ṭhian leh nangmahni lama ka hnathawhpui a ni a; tin, kan unaute hi chu kohhranho tirhkoh, Krista ropuina chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan in hmangaih tih hriatna leh, kan chhuanna che u hriatna chu kohhranho hmaah chuan an hnênah tilang rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte rawngbâwl thu zawng in hnêna ka ziak a ngai lo ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />in inpeihzia chu ka hre si a, chumi kawng thûah chuan, “Kum khat a ni tawh, Akaia ram chu inbuatsaihin an awm ta,” tiin, Makedonia rama mite hnênah ka chhuang ṭhîn che u a; chutichuan, in ṭhahnemngaihna chuan an zînga mi tam tak a chawk harh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, chumi kawng thûah chuan ka chhuanna che u chu eng mah lo a lo nih lohna tûrin unaute hi ka kaltîr dâwn a, ka sawi ang taka inbuatsaihin in lo awm theih nân;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chuti lo chuan, Makedonia rama mi tuten emaw mi lo zui hlauhvin, inbuatsaih lova an rawn hmuh che u chuan, keini (nangni kan ti lo) hi kan rinna che u kawngah hian kan mualpho dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, unaute hi in hnêna lo kal hmasaa, tlang taka thilpêk in tiam tawh kha lo siam lâwk tûra ngen ṭûlin ka ring a ni, chumi ngei chu lâk luih ang lova, tlang taka pêk ang zâwkin peih saa a lo awm nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chutiang kawngah chuan theh tlêm chuan a ât tlêm ang a, theh tam chuan a ât tam bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tinin ui chunga pe lovin, pêk loh theih loh anga ngaia pe hek lovin, an thinlunga an tum ang zêlin pe ṭheuh rawh se; Pathian chuan hlim taka petu a ni a hmangaih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin khawngaihna tinrêng in chungah a vûr thei a ni; chutichuan, nangnin engkimah a tâwk zet nei fovin, hnathawh ṭha tinrêng atân in ngah thei ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A sem darh a; Retheite hnênah a pe a, A felna chu kumkhuain a awm reng,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, thilphalna tinrêng, keimahni avânga Pathian hnêna lâwmthu sawina siamtu chu nei tûra engkima tihhausaka awmin, thehtu hnêna chi petu leh ei atâna chhang petu chuan, in theh tûr chi chu a pe che uin, a tihpunsak ang che u a, in felna rahte chu a tihhlâwksak bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />He chhawmdâwlna rawngbâwlna hian, mi thianghlimte tlâkchhamnate chu a phuhrûksak chauh pawh a ni si lo va, Pathian hnêna lâwmthu sawina tam taka changin a luang liam bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />He rawngbâwlna hian a fiahna che u avângin, Krista Chanchin Ṭha lama in thurin in zawm avâng leh, anmahni tân leh mi zawng zawng tâna thawhlâwma in thilphal avâng hian, Pathian an tiropui ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anmahni ngei pawhin in chunga Pathian khawngaihna nasa tak avângin, in tâna ṭawngṭai chungin an ngai hle che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thilpêk sawi hleih theih loh avângin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kei Paula, in zînga in mit hmuha thuhnuairawlh taka awma, in hnêna awm loh veleha nangmahni lam zuam si ṭhîna ngei hian, Krista zaidamna leh nunnêmnain ka ngên a che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a ni, in hnêna ka awm hunah ṭhenkhat, tisa anga awma min ruatte chunga huai taka awm ka tum ngamna ang hian ka zuam lohna tûr che uin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tisaah awm mah ila, tisa indo angin kan indo lo va
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />(keini inrâlthuamnate chu tisaa mi a ni si lo va, kulhpui nghet takte ṭhiatna tûra Pathian zârah thil ti thei tak a ni zâwk),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hnialnate leh thil sâng tinrêng Pathian hriatna dâl tûra sâng taka siamte chu ṭhiatin, ngaihtuahna tinrêng Krista thu awihna salah kan hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />in thu awihzia a famkim hunah chuan, thu âwih lohna zawng zawng phuba la tûrin kan inpeih bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In mit hmuha thil awmte chu a ni in en ṭhin ni. Tu pawhin Krista ta nia a inrin chuan, hei hi mahniin ngaihtuah leh rawh se, amah chu Krista ta a ni ang bawkin keini pawh kan nih ve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan thuneihna (nangmahni ṭhiat nân ni lova, nangmahni siam ṭhat nân zâwka Lalpan min pêk) hi chhuang nasa lehzual mah ila ka mualpho dâwn si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ka lehkhathawnte chuan tihhlauh che u tum anga ka lan loh nân chu chu ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A lehkhathawnte chu a ritin a khauh va, a taksa lam erawh chu a âwm nêm a, a ṭawng pawh a sitawm a ni,” an ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutiang mi chuan hei hi ngaihtuah rawh se, in hnêna kan awm loh laia lehkhathawna thûa kan awm angin, in hnêna kan awm hunah pawh thiltihah kan awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat mahni insawimawite zîngah chuan kan inchhiar tel ngam lo va, anmahni nên kan intehkhin ngam hek lo; amaherawhchu, anni zawng mahni leh mahni intehin, mahni leh mahni intehkhinin rilru nei lovin an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keini erawh zawng kan tehna tâwk aliamah chuan kan uang lo vang a, Pathianin bial min chantîr a, chu tehna ang zêl chuan kan uang zâwk ang, nangmahni pawh bial hial tûra tehna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bial phâk loh pui bial che u angin kan huam zau lutuk si lo; Krista Chanchin Ṭha hrilin in khaw thleng pawhin kan lo kal kha:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kan tehna tâwk liama mi, mi dang thawh rimte chu kan chhuang lo va; in rinna a ṭhan ang zêlin, kan bial chin ang zêlah, in zîngah nasa taka tihlenin kan awm ang tih beiseina kan nei zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Buatsaih sa kawng thûah chuan mi dang bial chhuang lovin, in piah lam ram thleng pawha Chanchin Ṭha kan hril theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, “A chhuang apiangin Lalpa chu chhuang rawh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahni insawimawi chuan fak a hlawh si lo va, Lalpan a sawimawi chuan fak a hlawh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ât deuhnaah hian nangnin min dawhtheih ka va duh êm! A ni, dawh pawh mi dawh thei ngei chhap e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian thîknain asin ka thîk che u ni; Krista hnênah chuan nula thianghlim anga ka pêk theihna tûr che uin, pasal pakhat ka hualsak si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, rûl chuan a ngamthlêmnain Evi a bum ang khân, Krista lama takna leh thianghlimna ata chu, eng emaw tiin in rilru an tikhawlo dah ang e, tih ka hlauthâwng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan hrilh che u ni lo, Isua dang hrila in hnêna lo kal apiang in lo ngaithei a, thlarau in chan ngai loh chu in chang a, Chanchin Ṭha dang in pawm ngai loh chu in pawm duh zêl mai maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng tirhkoh lian berte chu eng kawngah mah tluk loh ka inring lo asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thusawiah zawng ṭawng hmang thiam mah suh ila, hriatnaah chuan chutiang ka ni lo; a ni, engkimah, mi zawng zawng zîngah, nangmahni lama kan lantîr kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nih loh leh, Pathian Chanchin Ṭha a thlâwn ngawta ka hrila, chawisâna in awm theihna tûra ka intihhniam khân thil ka tisual a lo ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In zînga ka thawh lai khân kohhran dangten min chhawmdâwl a, nangmahni pui tûrin anni chu ka tihek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, in hnêna ka awma, ka tlâkchham lai khân tu mah ka tihautak lo va; unaute chuan Makedonia ram ata an lo kalin ka tlâkchhamna chu min rawn phuhrûksak si a; engkimah nangmahni tihautak lova ka insiam kha, khatiang khân ka insiam zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Krista thutak keimaha a awm ang hian, Akaia ram lama he ka chhuanna hi tu mân min tihrehsak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eng vângin nge? Ka hmangaih loh che u avâng em ni? Pathianin a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, remchânna hmu duhte lak ata remchânna chu ka sah chah theihna tûrin, ka tih ṭhin hi ka ti zêl ang; an chhuannaah chuan keimahni awm ang hian an lo awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi chutiangte chu Krista tirhkohva insiam chawp, tirhkoh derte, hnathawktu mi bum hmangte an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu chu a mak lo ve; Setana meuh pawh êng tirhkohvah a insiam chawp si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, a rawngbâwltute pawh chu, felna rawngbâwltuah insiam chawp mah sela thilmak a ni lo ve; chûngho tâwpna chu an thiltih ang zêlin a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka sawi leh ang, tu mân mi âah min ruat suh se; nimahsela, min ruat vêk chuan, kei pawhin tlêm tala ka chhuan ve theih nân mi â angin min dawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka sawi hi Lalpa thu angin ka sawi lo va, ka chhuan rinna hian â ang takin ka sawi zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tam takin tisa anga an chhuan avângin kei pawhin ka chhuang ve teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangni zawng mi fing in nih avângin mi âte chu lungawi takin in dawh si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miin bâwihah siam che u sela, ei zo duak che u sela, salah man che u sela, mahni inchawimawi sela, in hmaiah bêng che u sela, in dawh si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kan lo chak ta lo angin insitin ka sawi a ni. Nimahsela, tu pawhin eng kawngah pawh an ngam apiang (â takin han sawi ta ila) kei pawhin ka ngam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hebrai mite an ni maw? Kei pawh ka ni. Israel mite an ni maw? Kei pawh ka ni. Abrahama thlahte an ni maw? Kei pawh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Krista rawngbâwltute an ni maw? (mi â angin han sawi ta ila) Ka ni zâwk mah; thawh rimnaahte nasa lehzualin, tân ina tânnaahte nasa lehzualin, vuaknaahte hleihluak takin, thihnaahte vawi tam tak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda-te lakah vuakna vawi khata vawi sawmli tling lo vawi nga ka tâwk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />vawi thum tianga vuakin ka awm a, vawi khat lunga denin ka awm a, vawi thum lawng chhiatna ka tâwk a, zan khat leh ni khat tuifinriatah ka awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />khaw fannaahte vawi tam tak, luite laka hlauhawmahte, suamhmangte laka hlauhawmahte, ka chipuite laka hlauhawmahte, Jentail-te laka hlauhawmahte, khawpuia hlauhawmahte, thlalêra hlauhawmahte, tuifinriata hlauhawmahte, unau derte zînga hlauhawmahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />thawhhahna leh thawhrimnaahte, mutmawhnaahte vawi tam tak; rilṭâm leh tuihâlnaahte, chaw ngheinaahte, khawsik leh saruaka awmnaahte vawi tam tak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hêng pâwn lam thil ka sawi bâkah hian kohhranho zawng zawng ka ngaihtuahna, ni tin mi delh rengtu hi a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi chak lote ka tuarpui lo ngai em ni? Mi an tlûkin ka vei lo ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chhuang tûr ka nih vêk chuan ka chak lohna lam thilte a ni ka chhuan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa Isua Pathian leh Pa, kumkhuaa engthâwla awma chuan dâwt ka sawi lohzia a hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Damaska khuaah khân Lal Areta hnuaia rorêltu chuan min man tûrin Damaska mite khawpui chu a vêntîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tin, tukverhah kulh hrûlah chuan bâwmin min thlâk a; tichuan, a kut ata ka relhru hlen ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka chhuang rêng rêng tûr a ni. Ṭhat zawng a ṭha lo va; nimahsela, Lalpa hnên ata inlârna leh hriattîrna thu ka sawi kai teh zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kristaa mi pakhat ka hria, chu mi ngei chu kum sâwm leh kum li a ni ta (taksain emaw a awm ka hre lo, taksa lovin emaw a awm ka hre hek lo; Pathianin a hria), vân thumna meuhvah khian lâk chhohvin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chu mi ngei chu (taksain emaw a awm, taksa lovin emaw ka hre lo; Pathianin a hria),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paradis-a lâk chhohva a awm leh, thu sawi hleih theih loh, mihring sawi thian lohte chu a hria tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi chutiang chu ka chhuang ang; nimahsela, ka chak lohna lo chu mahni ka inchhuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhuang duh mah ila mi â ka ni lo vang, thu tak tak ka sawi dâwn si a; nimahsela, ka insûm ang, chuti lo chuan, tu pawhin mi hmuh ang leh ka laka thu an hriat ang aiin min ngai ropui zâwk dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hriattîrnate chu a nasat êm êm avânga ka inngaihhlut lutuk loh nân tisaah hlîng mi pe a ni, Setana tirhkoh, kut thak hnawih nâna mi hmangtu tûr chu; chuti lo chuan, ka inngaihlu lutuk dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi chungchâng thûah chuan mi kiansan theih nân Lalpa chu vawi thum ka dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Ka khawngaihna i tân a tâwk e; ka thiltihtheihna hi chak lohnaah asin tihfamkimin a awm ni,” a ti ta a. Chutichuan, Krista thiltihtheihna chu ka chunga a awm theih nân, lâwm êm êmin ka chak lohnate hi ka chhuang tawh zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, Krista avângin chak lohnaahte, chhiatnaahte, nêksawrnaahte, tihduhdahnaahte, hnawhchêpnaahte ka lâwm ṭhîn a ni; ka chak loh apiangin a ni ka chak ṭhin ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lo â ta a nih hi: nangnin â lo thei lovah min siam a ni; kei chu nangmahni min chawimawi tûr ka ni asin, eng mah ni mah suh ila, eng kawngah pawh tirhkoh lian berte chu ka tluk lo si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tirhkoh nih chhinchhiahnate chu chhelna tinrêng neiin, chhinchhiahnate, thilmakte, thiltihtheihnatein in zînga tih a nih tak tak kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eng kawngah nge ni kohhran dangte aia hnuai zâwka siama in awmna chu? Keimah ngei hian ka tihhautak loh che u kawngah khân a nih nghâl loh chuan. Chumi dik lohnaah chuan min ngaidam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh u, hei hi in hnêna lo kal tûra ka inpeih vawi thumna tûr a ni; tin, ka tihautak lo vang che u, in ta chu zawng ka ni si lo va, nangmahni a ni ka zawn zâwk che u ni; faten nu leh pate tân an khâwl khâwm tûr a ni lo va, nu leh paten fate tân an khâwl khâwmsak zâwk tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, kei zawngin in thlarau tân lâwm êm êmin ka hmang ral ang a, inhmang ral vekin ka awm bawk ang. A chuang a liama ka hmangaih che u avâng khân, keiin hmangaihna tlêm zâwk ka dawn phah a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, kei chuan ka tihautak lo che u ni ta sela; nimahsela, mi vervêk rêng rêng lo niin, ngamthlêmin ka man che u a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In hnêna ka tirhte zîngah khân tu emaw tal hmangin ka hlâwk phah che u em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tita chu ka fuih a, a rualin unaupa chu ka tîr a ni. Tita chuan hlâwk phahna rêng rêng a nei che u em ni? Rilru hmun khat pua lêng dûn kan ni lo vem ni? Hniak thuhmun chiaha lêng dûn kan ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In hnêna kan thiam thu sawiah min lo ngai reng a ni âwm a. Kristaah chuan Pathian mit hmuhah a ni thu kan sawi ni. Nimahsela, duh takte u, engkim hi nangmahni siamṭhatna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka lo kal hunah eng emaw tiin ka duh anga ka rawn hmuh loh che ua, kei pawh in duh angin mi hmu lo dah ang, tih leh, eng emaw tiin inhauna te, inîtsîkna te, thinurna te, inkhinna te, inrêlna te, sesea thu lâk te, inngaihhlut lutukna te, buaina te a lo awm dah ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tih leh, ka lo kal hunin ka Pathianin in zîngah mi timualpho leh pekin, tûn hma lama thil tisualtute zînga thil bawlhhlawh tih te, inngaih te, hur te chînga sim si lo mi tam takte chu ka ṭah dah ang e tih ka hlau asin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hei hi in hnêna ka lo kal vawi thumna tûr a ni. Hretute pahnih emaw, pathum emaw kaah chuan thu tinrêng tihnghehin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sawi lâwk tawh a; tin, Krista, keimaha thu sawi ṭhîntu chu fiahna in zawn avângin, vawi hnihnaa in hnêna ka awm laia ka sawi ang khân, tûnah in hnêna awm lovin tûn hma lama thil tisualtute hnênah leh, mi dang zawng zawng hnênah ka sawi lâwk leh dâwn, “Ka lo kal leh chuan ka zuah lo vang,” tih hi; ani chu nangmahni lamah a chak lo lo va, in zîngah thil ti thei tak a ni zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chu chak lohna avângin khenbehin a awm a ni a; nimahsela, Pathian thiltihtheihna avângin a nung ta reng a ni. Keini pawh amahah chuan kan chak lo a ni; nimahsela, nangmahni lama Pathian thiltihtheihna avângin a hnênah kan nung ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rinnaah chuan in awm emaw, nangmahni ngei inchhin ṭhîn ula; nangmahni ngei infiah ṭhîn rawh u. A nih loh leh, nangmahniah Isua Krista chu a awm tih nangmahni ngeiin in hre fiah lo vem ni? Duh loh in nih nghâl loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keini erawh chu duh lohvin kan awm lo tih in la hriain ka ring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, thil rêng rêng in tihsual lohna tûrin Pathian hnênah kan dîl ṭhîn a; chu chu, keini hi duhawma kan lan theihna tûr a ni lo va, nangnin a mawi apiang in tih theih nân a ni zâwk, keini chu duh loh angin awm mah ila.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thutak ṭan tûr lo chuan thutak do tûrin eng mah kan ti thei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keini kan chak loh lai pawha nangni in chak hian kan lâwm ṭhîn asin; hei hi kan dîl bawk ṭhîn, in ṭhat famkimna tûr hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan tichhe tûr ni lova, siam ṭha tûr zâwka Lalpan thuneihna mi pêk ang zêl khân, in hnêna ka awm huna na taka ka zilh loh nân che u, in hnêna ka awm loh lai hian hêng thu hi ka ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan unaute u, lâwm takin awm rawh u. Tihṭhat famkimin awm ula; thlamuang takin awm ula; rilru hmun khat pu ula, lungrual takin awm rawh u; tichuan, hmangaihna leh remna Pathian chu in hnênah a awm dâwn zuk nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fawh thianghlimin chibai inbûk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi thianghlim zawng zawngte hian chibai an bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna te, Pathian hmangaihna te, Thlarau Thianghlim pâwlna te chu in zaa hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
